  "card": "bitcoin-cli -rpcclienttimeout=0 is documented as disabling timeouts, but it currently fails immediately on macOS with 'Could not connect to the server'. This regression occurred in #34342 because the CLI converted zero into a 5-year timeout, exceeding macOS select() limit of 10^8 seconds and returning EINVAL. This PR caps timeouts in Sock::WaitMany to INT_MAX milliseconds and adds an explicit Sock::NO_TIMEOUT mode passed as null to select() and -1 to poll().",
